WEBVTT

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.760
"The War Chronicles of Ronaldo"

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.760
This is more interesting than I expected.

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:15.680
You were so full of yourself that you gave
me your autobiography when we first met,

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.890
but this isn't bad reading--

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.100
Sand...

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.980
I'll kill you.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.810
It really is interesting.

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.060
Your experience as a hunter has translated
well into an entertaining novel.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.440
Shut up. Your flattery is pissing me off.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.280
By the way, I bought some Hokkaido
Special Select Milk. You can have it.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.870
You're so easy.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:42.080
If a pretty girl tries to sell you
a painting, don't buy it.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.080
Who're you calling an easy mark, bastard?

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:46.120
Yes, this is Ronaldo--

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.380
This is Fukuma from Autumn Books.

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:53.300
"Autumn Books"

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:53.300
"Mr. Fukuma"

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.300
"Autumn Books"
"Mr. Fukuma"

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.300
Is the manuscript for <i>The War Chronicles</i>
<i>of Ronaldo </i>volume 2 ready yet?

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.720
Is the manuscript for <i>The War Chronicles</i>
<i>of Ronaldo </i>volume 2 ready yet?

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:37.110
Thanks to everyone reading
<i>The Ronaldo Chronicles</i>,

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:39.110
"Assault! Mr. Fukuma"
Thanks to everyone reading
<i>The Ronaldo Chronicles</i>,

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:41.530
"Assault! Mr. Fukuma"
a second volume is scheduled
to be released.

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:45.410
The manuscript for that was due today...

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:47.700
"Please don't look for me"

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:47.700
So I'm going to hide for a while.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.830
"Please don't look for me"

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.830
Did you forget about it?

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.130
Shut up! I had a lot going on
because of you!

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:56.460
My only options now are to flee the
country or hide in a nuclear bomb shelter!

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:58.840
Apologize and start writing it
properly right now.

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:03.180
You can only say that because you don't
know what Mr. Fukuma's like when he's mad!

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:07.220
Is Mr. Fukuma the person
you were talking to earlier?

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.890
Yeah...

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.730
"Autumn Books"
"Editor - Fukuma"
Mr. Fukuma is the editor
for <i>The Ronaldo Chronicles</i>.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:14.900
"Autumn Books"
"Editor - Fukuma"
He's still young, but he's capable and
confident. A top editor at Autumn Books.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:15.770
He's still young, but he's capable and
confident. A top editor at Autumn Books.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:18.190
What? He's too good for you.

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:20.990
His fighting style is Fist of the
South Star Editorial Battle-Axe.

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:23.160
His weapon is a battle-axe,
just like the name says.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:24.700
What?!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:28.240
Why does an editor have mastery
over such a scary fighting style?

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:32.290
Having mastery of martial arts and weapons
is a requirement to work for Autumn Books.

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:35.000
It's the policy of the whole company?!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.500
Soon after I first met Mr. Fukuma,

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:42.260
I treated writing <i>The Ronaldo Chronicles</i>
as something I did in my free time...

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:46.100
Ronaldo, your progress on
the manuscript seems slow.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:49.180
Oh, sorry! My day job's
been keeping me busy...

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.980
Is that so?

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.360
I am so very sorry...

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:02.450
You should meet your
deadlines for any job.

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:07.370
Ever since then, I decided that
I would never defy him again.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.370
If he finds out I haven't
written anything yet,

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.250
he'll chop off even what's below
my underwear this time, and I'll die!

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.540
Even if I were to survive,
I'd be a woman starting tomorrow!

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:14.750
Oh, Ronalina...

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.250
"Ronalina"

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.250
Oh, Ronalina...

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:17.500
Stop with the Ronalina act.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.460
I don't want to imagine it.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.800
That's how it is, so--

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.130
"Ahhhh"

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:24.680
Sand!

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.800
--Y-Yes, this is Ronaldo!
--This is Fukuma.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.220
How's the manuscript going?

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:30.140
Uh, yeah, well--

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:34.060
I can't wait to read your manuscript.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:37.150
U-Um, what's that banging
sound in the background?

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:41.740
I'm testing the door of the
new iron maiden I bought.

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.110
He's gonna kill me!

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:45.700
I heard you've teamed up with a vampire,

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:48.580
so I'm looking forward to
reading about that, too.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:51.370
U-Um, that's, uh--

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.790
A-Argh, what are you doing, Draluc?!

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:58.920
What's the matter, Ronaldo?

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:02.090
Draluc... He's attacking me--

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:04.420
Don't--

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.640
Don't worry about me or the manuscript!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.720
Are you all right, Ronaldo?

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.100
I'm fine, but the manuscript--

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:16.520
I understand. I'll go over there right now
and chop down that vampire.

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:20.020
If I do that, I can have
the manuscript, right?

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.320
Huh?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:28.740
Idiot! Why did you get me
involved?! Die by yourself!

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:31.280
Shut up! I wasn't expecting it
to turn out like this!

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:34.200
John, help me! Protect me!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.750
Stop that! You're putting
John on the spot!

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.290
You don't have to sacrifice
yourself for him, John!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:43.000
A-Anyway, once Mr. Fukuma
gets here, it'll be over for us!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.090
We must figure out a plan to save us
from this hopeless situation!

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:49.470
This is just for temporary peace of mind,
but let's power up the eye-beam thing.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:52.310
Why didn't you bring the dozens
you had with you?!

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:55.390
Quiet! You think of something, too!

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:57.730
U-Um, uh... um, um...

00:05:57.730 --> 00:06:00.230
L-Light a bunch of fires around
the agency or something?

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.190
Trying to scare off animals?

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.110
Huh? Um, then, uh---

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:06.030
Cats! Get a bunch of cats
that are so cute that--

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:08.610
Calm down! Take a deep breath!

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:10.660
Actually, it'd be faster
if you ran away from here!

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:13.280
It doesn't matter where, just hide--

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:19.420
Hey.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:25.090
I-Idiot, no. No one could get from Tokyo
to Shin-Yokohama that fast...

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.690
He's dragging his battle-axe!

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:45.190
It's <i>your </i>problem!

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:47.150
Hurry up and get out of here
and get chopped up!

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:48.780
"Ronaldo Vampire Hunter Agency"
"Everyone welcome"

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:48.780
<i>You </i>should be a decoy!

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:51.240
"Ronaldo Vampire Hunter Agency"
"Everyone welcome"

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:51.240
Ronaldo Junior isn't gonna regenerate!

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:54.660
Sand!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.700
A-A blackout!

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.830
Oh, no! The eye-beam thing
went into sleep mode!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.880
Flashlight! Flashlight!

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:05.590
Hey, if you can't see,
then don't keep moving around--

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:10.970
Wait! Since I can see in the dark,
I can run away by myself!

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:14.720
Farewell, Ronaldo!
I'm abandoning you!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:23.190
If I use a light, then he'll
figure out where I am.

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:25.690
Damn it, where's Mr. Fukuma?

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:28.610
Ronaldo, over here.

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.610
What's over there?

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:34.450
I got him, Mr. Fukuma!

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:40.540
How very kind of you.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.590
Now, Ronaldo, can I have your manuscript?

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.920
M-Mr. Fukuma...!

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:51.050
How dare you betray me, Draluc!

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:53.760
Vampires are supposed to betray hunters.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:55.350
Besides...

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:58.640
Mr. Fukuma said they had extra games
in the editorial department I could have,

00:07:58.640 --> 00:07:59.770
so I couldn't help myself.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:02.690
A vampire shouldn't be lured by things!

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:07.520
And anyway, there's no way
you could hold me down!

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.280
Oh, yeah, I forgot!

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:13.150
Sorry, Mr. Fukuma! I can't die yet!

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:16.490
Please wait another two weeks
for the manuscript!

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.000
Hey, wai--

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:38.180
"Groan..."

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:42.480
Now, you can work there
until you finish writing it.

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:45.600
Oh, so that's how you use this.

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:53.240
"Falling Like Flowers in Shin-Yokohama"

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:56.780
The cell culture experiment was a success.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:58.030
All that's left is to see
how effective this is...

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:02.160
"Vampire Research Center"
"Director - Yomotsuzaka"
All that's left is to see
how effective this is...

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:19.390
Hey, Ronaldo. About my pay--

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:20.310
Huh?

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:23.560
Do I get it the following month?
Is it a fixed salary with commission?

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.810
What?!

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:27.350
How much do I get this
month? About 500,000?

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:29.400
What?!

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:32.440
What you're saying is so crazy
I don't know where to even start!

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:36.400
There's no way you're
getting a single yen! Idiot!

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:40.580
Sand...

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:41.620
Stop messing around!

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:41.910
What are you gonna do to my plan
to rebuild Castle Draluc?!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.580
"2 Trillion Yen Savings Box"

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.580
What are you gonna do to my plan
to rebuild Castle Draluc?!

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:48.170
"2 Trillion Yen Savings Box"

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:48.170
Even if you make 500,000 yen a month,
it'll take 330,000 years to fill that!

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.380
"2 Trillion Yen Savings Box"

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.380
Do you realize that?!

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.000
Before talking about salary or whatever,

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:53.170
maybe you should do some
work, damn small fry!

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:55.670
Va...! Vampire!

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:57.630
What now?

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:59.550
Hello, this is Ronaldo.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:02.010
Ronaldo, are you free?

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:05.020
A vampire just appeared.
Come give me a hand.

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:11.730
Thanks, Ronaldo.
Everyone's busy tonight.

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:13.070
What kind of vampire is it?

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:13.820
"Vampire Hunter"
"'Left Hand of Iron' Satetsu"

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:17.700
"Vampire Hunter"
"'Left Hand of Iron' Satetsu"
A vampire captured by the Vampire
Research Center ran away.

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:22.740
Apparently, it's a vampire
that can control plants.

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:25.120
We should hurry up and hunt it down.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:29.620
Don't get in the way by mistake, Dralu--!

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:33.880
The guy that was with you
put that up earlier and went away...

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:35.420
Tell me if he does that!

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:39.090
I-I didn't know if it was
something I should tell you...

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:46.180
You don't take me seriously. That's why I
was able to steal a march on you, Ronaldo.

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:50.980
I, Draluc, will hunt down the inferior
vampires around there before you do.

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.650
When I do...

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:54.230
I underestimated you!

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:55.400
Yes.

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:59.320
Sorry, Ronaldo.
I'll be an overnight hero!

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:00.360
It's not just the compensation.

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:03.450
Making the whole agency mine
isn't too much to dream of.

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:05.740
When that happens-- What the--?

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:07.500
Grade Schooler Tackle!

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.620
Sand...

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:12.880
All right! I defeated the bad vampire!

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:14.210
Good job, Shin!

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:16.460
Like taking candy from a baby.

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:17.550
Yeah!

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:20.470
Who are you people?!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.220
We are...

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:25.510
...the Shin-Yokohama Boy Hunters!

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:28.430
We heard that a bad vampire appeared.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.520
So we came to defeat him!

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:31.810
And so--

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:34.360
Grade Schooler Stomping!

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:35.820
Stop that!

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:39.780
You've got the wrong vampire!
I'm not a bad vampire.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:44.820
I'm actually a super cool
vampire who helps hunters!

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.330
What is it?

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:49.830
Shh! Be quiet.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:53.120
Your playing around
lured out the real one.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:59.300
This isn't a small fry. It's a superior
vampire--a vampire lord.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:02.180
He smells like a compatriot.

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:07.970
My compatriot, who bares his fangs
at humans! Come, show yourself!

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:24.740
My foolish compatriot,
who works with humans...

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:34.000
"Vampire - Nudenium"
I am the vampire, Nudenium.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:39.880
I will bury this town in flowers.
If you get in my way...

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:43.470
...I will not go easy on you!

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:46.340
That? That smells like your compatriot?!

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.010
I take it back! I take it back!

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:53.100
Damn it, don't get scared!
Guys, Formation Delta!

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:54.230
They're running away!

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:55.900
You're not as popular as I thought!

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:57.730
Shut up!

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:02.690
Oh? Will you hold your ground?
Interesting. I like you, compatriot.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:03.700
And you, boy!

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:05.570
Don't like me! Don't like me!

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:10.410
I'm sorry for trying to sound fancy,
but will you stop calling me "compatriot"?

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:13.790
First, I'll "plant" you two!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:28.640
Now, swallow this seed.

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:30.100
No way!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:33.390
If you swallow it,
you will become of my blood,

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:35.890
and you will be able to inherit my power.

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.850
No way!

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:38.860
I can't take it anymore!

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:41.110
I don't want to get more involved
with this guy than I already am!

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:43.990
Even if you lose your
nerve now, it's too late!

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:49.620
Special Move: Swift Blossom Running!

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:55.710
He got around us! He's really fast
and hard to deal with!

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:58.580
If it's come to this, we have
no choice but to fight, Damn Kid!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.960
How are we supposed to fight <i>that</i>,
Damn Weak Old Man?

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.710
Quiet!

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:08.510
Draw him close for an instant!
I'll surprise him and bite him!

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:10.640
Listen, with vampires,

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:14.520
whoever has stronger blood
can control the other.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:17.850
If my blood is superior,
then I can control that guy.

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:19.810
What if you can't?

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.650
Yo-ho!

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.320
We'll be made to swallow that
seed and end up like this.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:26.030
I'd rather die!

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:29.610
He's here! Draw him to you somehow!

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:32.660
Take this! Grade Schooler Sand Attack!

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.740
Impudent child.

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.290
I won't fall for that!

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:41.960
What?!

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.930
Damn Weak Old Man...?

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:06.480
You almost got me.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:10.030
Now, become of my bloo--

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.250
Damn it.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:28.260
I caught something gross.

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:32.180
R-Ronaldo, well done!

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:36.060
What do you mean, "well done"?
Going off on your own like that!

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:42.100
Oh, but I worked pretty hard
this time, don't you think?

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:47.530
Well, I guess it wasn't bad for you.

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:52.110
That's right! Now, pay me for my work!
I think about 1,000,000 yen should do it.

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:54.870
Okay, fine. I'll give you payment in kind!

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:56.200
No thanks.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:01.290
I didn't think it'd work so well.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.790
It's just a nutritional supplement.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.010
Here we go.

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:13.180
Oh, my, it's gone completely wild.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:21.560
"Can a Bang on the Wall Kill Him?"

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:22.890
"Can a Bang on the Wall Kill Him?"

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:22.890
What the hell? Why is the lid
of your coffin on the floor?!

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:24.940
What the hell? Why is the lid
of your coffin on the floor?!

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:26.940
Ouch! Look, there's blood!

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:30.030
Your blood? That doesn't
sound very appetizing.

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:31.240
I'll kill you!

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:32.400
Don't be angry.

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:37.330
For a vampire, what's most delicious
is the lifeblood of a young virgin.

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.490
I'm mad about the lid!

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:42.080
I <i>have </i>only been drinking milk recently.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.960
It's about time I have some
blood that's full of life.

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:48.920
Oh, I want to take a bite out
of a girl with a pretty nape.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:52.420
If you say that outside, you'll be
arrested before getting hunted down.

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.340
Excuse me!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:56.220
Yes, coming!

00:16:57.350 --> 00:16:59.350
Hello there.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:02.980
Is this the residence of a Mr. Ronaldo?

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:05.440
Is this voluntary? Should I call a lawyer?

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:08.110
Did you do something
you should be arrested for?

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:13.280
Unfortunately, we did not
come here today to arrest you.

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:17.370
I'm Hinaichi from the Kanagawa Prefectural
Police Vampire Control Division.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:17.660
"Vice-Captain - Hinaichi"

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:22.120
"Vice-Captain - Hinaichi"
Hunter Ronaldo, I have come
to investigate your vampire.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:26.330
The Vampire Control Division...

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:28.170
We'll leave you to it, then.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:30.750
Thanks for bringing me here.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:33.550
Well? What are you
planning to investigate?

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:35.010
"Vampire Danger Levels"
"Earthworm - Leave it alone"

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:35.010
Well? What are you
planning to investigate?

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:37.890
"Vampire Danger Levels"
"Earthworm - Leave it alone"

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:37.890
You'll just see that the idiot is at
the same level as an earthworm.

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:38.890
"Vampire Danger Levels"
"Earthworm - Leave it alone"

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:38.890
It's just to be safe.

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:40.430
For example,

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:44.430
has he said anything dangerous that would
indicate a desire to harm humans?

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.980
You guys sure are sticklers for the rules.

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:49.060
Nothing like that would even
cross that idiot's mi--

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:50.520
He's said it before!

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:53.740
Oh, I want to take a bite out
of a girl with a pretty nape.

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:56.650
He was totally saying something that
would cause a human harm earlier!

00:17:56.650 --> 00:18:00.660
"Suspension of Business"

00:17:56.650 --> 00:18:00.660
This is bad! If she hears that, it could
drag me down and ruin my life, too!

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:04.160
Damn it, why did Vamp Control
have to send a <i>girl</i>?

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:06.670
And she's pretty cute, too!
What are they playing at?

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:07.000
"That Idiot"

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:07.000
And she's pretty cute, too!
What are they playing at?

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.460
"That Idiot"

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.460
If he sees her, that idiot will
100% let something slip.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:12.090
I can't let them meet.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:16.470
I can feel the bad end coming
if he gets even one glimpse of her.

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:17.880
What should I do?

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:21.640
I have to do something before
they meet... Something...!

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:26.520
I'll kill him! I'll kill that idiot
before they meet!

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:33.650
To do that, I have to keep the girl
here somehow... and kill that guy!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:36.320
What's the matter? Hurry up
and let me see that vampir--

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:38.360
Whoops, I slipped!

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:42.370
Secret Technique: Hunter Wall Slam!

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:46.250
Wh-What are you doing out of the blue?
What are you trying to do?

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:49.210
Draluc should've died with the
vibrations that went through the wall.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:51.630
Hey, are you listening?

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.000
How was it?

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.050
--I failed!

00:18:58.050 --> 00:18:59.220
--At what?!
--I failed!

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:01.430
What do you mean, you failed?

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:06.390
Don't tell me you're hiding
something about that vampire!

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:07.850
If that's the case--

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:10.310
Secret Technique: Hunter 16-Beat Stomp!

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:12.610
What are you doing?!

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:15.780
Well... There was a bug crawling around,
so I was trying to trample it.

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:18.950
Why do you keep looking like
you've accomplished something?

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:22.990
It was an ultimate move to kill him
with the vibrations in the floor, but...

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:26.450
Maybe vibrations aren't good enough?!

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:30.830
In the first place, it's hard
to tell if he's died or not.

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.250
John!

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:36.550
What, is that your armadillo?

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:38.760
Um, well...

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.630
I was worried for a second.
But it's a good chance--

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:43.890
There, there, John...

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:48.390
I need a favor. Give Lord Dral
a little punch and kill him for me.

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:53.650
S-Sorry! I was kidding! I-I'm sorry!
S-Sorry about that, John.

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:57.610
Will you just make a little ball for me?
That's all you need to do.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:01.070
And then, with this garlic...

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.490
Secret Technique: Hunter Throw-In!

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:05.740
'Madillo!

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:09.540
If John unrolls in the other room, then...

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:11.670
...Draluc will die from
the smell of garlic!

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:14.920
Sorry, John! I'm really sorry!
Do your best!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:22.680
John!

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.090
John...!

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:26.010
What's all the racket about?

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:32.270
Stop messing around!
What are you trying to...?

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:39.860
--Dral--
--Oh, what a beautiful lady.

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:42.070
--Oh, what a beautiful lady.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:44.660
I apologize for Ronaldo's rudeness.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:55.880
I am honored to make your acquaintance.
Did you have business with me?

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:58.630
Huh?

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:03.010
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What is this vampire doing?!

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:07.300
F-Fine! That hunter wasted my time
today with his strange behavior!

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:11.600
I will return another day!
Wait for what's coming to you!

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:16.860
You... What was that earlier
that set my teeth on edge?

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:21.440
What are you talking about?
I was just being polite to a lady.

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:25.700
My, her blood seemed
delicious--she was cute.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:28.660
Maybe if we become friends,
she'll let me have a sip.

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:30.540
I look forward to her return!

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:33.040
You <i>are </i>thinking dangerous thoughts!

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:36.290
What dangerous thoughts? I--

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.500
Hm?

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:40.960
It stinks!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:42.300
Sand!

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:48.470
S-Sorry. Really, I'm so sorry, John.

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:53.350
I said I'm sorry...

00:21:57.690 --> 00:21:59.150
Those of my blood believe

00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:03.320
the human society convenient and
useful to us should be preserved.

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:04.990
In other words,
it seems fun, so we'll help.

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:06.950
"Protectors of humans
who fight in the night"

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:06.950
In other words,
it seems fun, so we'll help.

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:09.490
That's how it is.

00:22:09.490 --> 00:22:13.290
I'll risk my life to beat you,
damn bastard!

00:22:13.290 --> 00:22:16.670
The vampire dies in no time.
